    <location value="452"/>
    <location value="150"/>
<![CDATA[This special treatment of  NULL  is why, in the previous section, it was necessary to determine which animals are no longer alive using  death IS NOT NULL  instead of  death <> NULL .]]>  </text>
  <text>
