    <location value="158"/>
    <location value="294"/>
    <location value="164"/>
    Two  NULL  values are regarded as equal in a  GROUP BY .
  </text>
  <text>
    <location value="85"/>
    <location value="172"/>
    <location value="476"/>
    <location value="185"/>
    When doing an  ORDER BY ,  NULL  values are presented first if you do  ORDER BY ... ASC  and last if you do  ORDER BY ... DESC .
  </text>
  <text>
